#: port/app/game_archives.cpp:713
msgid "Unpacking the game needs {0} of free space, and {1} is free."
msgstr "Para descomprimir el juego hacen falta {0} de espacio libre, y hay {1} libres."

#. why an archived game could not start; {0} is the folder the games unpacked from archives are kept in
#: port/app/game_archives.cpp:725 port/app/game_archives.cpp:800
